<view class="pictureWall data-v-8e170b98">
    <uni-navbar bgColor="#339A81" bind:__l="__l" class="data-v-8e170b98" type="fixed" vueId="e9d04464-1"></uni-navbar>
    <view class="container data-v-8e170b98">
        <image class="headimg data-v-8e170b98" src="https://eshopfile.zhiyousx.com/2022032811053297093.png"></image>
        <view bindtap="__e" class="buy flex data-v-8e170b98" data-event-opts="{{[ [ 'tap',[ [ 'toSpot',['$event'] ] ] ] ]}}">了<view class="_br data-v-8e170b98"></view>解<view class="_br data-v-8e170b98"></view>更<view class="_br data-v-8e170b98"></view>多</view>
        <view class="wall data-v-8e170b98">
            <view class="{{['uploadBox','flex','data-v-8e170b98',imgurl?'reUpload':'']}}">
                <view class="flex data-v-8e170b98">
                    <image class="data-v-8e170b98" src="https://eshopfile.zhiyousx.com/2022032910330161250.png"></image>
                    <view bindtap="__e" class="uptext data-v-8e170b98" data-event-opts="{{[ [ 'tap',[ [ 'clk',[0] ] ] ] ]}}" wx:if="{{!imgurl}}">上传<view class="_br data-v-8e170b98"></view>照片</view>
                    <view bindtap="__e" class="uptext data-v-8e170b98" data-event-opts="{{[ [ 'tap',[ [ 'clk',[0] ] ] ] ]}}" wx:else>继续<view class="_br data-v-8e170b98"></view>上传</view>
                </view>
            </view>
            <image class="userupload data-v-8e170b98" src="{{imgurl}}" wx:if="{{imgurl}}"></image>
            <view class="img1 imgbox data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{recommendlist[0]}}">
                <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="aspectFill" src="{{recommendlist[0].splitPicUrl}}"></image>
                <text class="data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{recommendlist[0].nickName}}">{{'@'+recommendlist[0].nickName||''}}</text>
            </view>
            <view class="box1 flex data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{recommendlist[0]}}">
                <view class="box2 flex data-v-8e170b98">
                    <view class="box2-top imgbox data-v-8e170b98">
                        <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="aspectFill" src="{{recommendlist[1].splitPicUrl}}"></image>
                        <text class="data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{recommendlist[1].nickName}}">{{'@'+recommendlist[1].nickName||''}}</text>
                    </view>
                    <view class="box3 flex data-v-8e170b98">
                        <view class="imgbox data-v-8e170b98">
                            <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="aspectFill" src="{{recommendlist[2].splitPicUrl}}"></image>
                            <text class="data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{recommendlist[2].nickName}}">{{'@'+recommendlist[3].nickName||''}}</text>
                        </view>
                        <view class="imgbox data-v-8e170b98">
                            <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="aspectFill" src="{{recommendlist[4].splitPicUrl}}"></image>
                            <text class="data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{recommendlist[4].nickName}}">{{'@'+recommendlist[4].nickName||''}}</text>
                        </view>
                    </view>
                </view>
                <view class="box1-right imgbox data-v-8e170b98">
                    <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="aspectFill" src="{{recommendlist[3].splitPicUrl}}"></image>
                    <text class="data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{recommendlist[3].nickName}}">{{'@'+recommendlist[2].nickName}}</text>
                </view>
            </view>
            <view class="totalinfo data-v-8e170b98" wx:if="{{uploadnum&&uploadnum>0&&!imgurl}}">{{'共有'+uploadnum+'人已上传'}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="recommend section flex data-v-8e170b98">
            <image class="titleimg data-v-8e170b98" mode="widthFix" src="https://eshopfile.zhiyousx.com/2022032814460018228.png"></image>
            <view class="monthdata data-v-8e170b98">
                <view bindtap="__e" class="item data-v-8e170b98" data-event-opts="{{[ [ 'tap',[ [ 'viewmore',['$0'],[ [ ['monthlist','',index] ] ] ] ] ] ]}}" wx:for="{{$root.l0}}">
                    <image class="mImg data-v-8e170b98" src="{{item.m0}}"></image>
                    <view class="infobox flex data-v-8e170b98">
                        <view class="imgBox flex data-v-8e170b98">
                            <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="aspectFill" src="{{option}}" wx:if="{{i<4}}" wx:for="{{item.$orig.splitPicUrlList}}" wx:for-index="i" wx:for-item="option"></image>
                        </view>
                        <text class="data-v-8e170b98">{{item.$orig.num+'张'}}</text>
                        <uni-icons bind:__l="__l" class="data-v-8e170b98" color="#555555" size="12" type="arrowright" vueId="{{'e9d04464-2-'+index}}"></uni-icons>
                    </view>
                </view>
            </view>
        </view>
        <view class="rule section flex data-v-8e170b98">
            <image class="titleimg data-v-8e170b98" mode="widthFix" src="https://eshopfile.zhiyousx.com/2022032817330713928.png"></image>
            <view class="content data-v-8e170b98">
                <view class="data-v-8e170b98">1、上传图片照片请包含人像，以更能体现动物园的动物、景色为宜；</view>
                <view class="data-v-8e170b98">2、每月评选3位月度之星，可以获得动物园的精美文创，工作人员将与你联系；</view>
                <view class="data-v-8e170b98">3、所有的月度之星，将有机会获得动物园随后活动的免费体验资格；</view>
                <view class="data-v-8e170b98">4、所有上传的图片，均有机会登上动物园千人合影爱心照片墙，将在园内向游客展示；</view>
                <view class="data-v-8e170b98">5、如不希望照片被选作精选展示或在动物园千人合影爱心照片墙展示，请联系游陕西平台删除；</view>
                <view class="data-v-8e170b98">6、参与活动即视为同意秦岭野生动物园及游陕西使用该照片作为宣传使用，游陕西平台对此次活动拥有最终解释权。</view>
            </view>
        </view>
        <view class="logo flex data-v-8e170b98">
            <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="heightFix" src="https://eshopfile.zhiyousx.com/2022040110194010653.png" style="margin-right:20rpx;"></image>
            <image class="data-v-8e170b98" mode="heightFix" src="https://eshopfile.zhiyousx.com/2022033110024287367.png"></image>
        </view>
    </view>
    <u-popup bind:__l="__l" bind:input="__e" borderRadius="20" class="data-v-8e170b98" data-event-opts="{{[ [ '^input',[ [ '__set_model',[ '','showNotice','$event',[] ] ] ] ] ]}}" maskCustomStyle="{{background:'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)'}}" mode="center" value="{{showNotice}}" vueId="e9d04464-3" vueSlots="{{['default']}}">
        <view class="hasnotice data-v-8e170b98">
            <view class="title data-v-8e170b98">照片使用权协议</view>
            <view class="data-v-8e170b98">1、上传图片照片请包含人像，以更能体现动物园的动物、景色为宜；</view>
            <view class="data-v-8e170b98">2、每月评选3位月度之星，可以获得动物园的精美文创，工作人员将与你联系；</view>
            <view class="data-v-8e170b98">3、所有的月度之星，将有机会获得动物园随后活动的免费体验资格；</view>
            <view class="data-v-8e170b98">4、参与活动即视为同意秦岭野生动物园及游陕西使用该照片作为宣传使用，游陕西平台对此次活动拥有最终解释权。</view>
            <view bindtap="__e" class="close flex data-v-8e170b98" data-event-opts="{{[ [ 'tap',[ [ 'agree',['$event'] ] ] ] ]}}">我已阅读并同意</view>
        </view>
    </u-popup>
    <avatar bind:__l="__l" bind:upload="__e" class="data-v-8e170b98 vue-ref" data-event-opts="{{[ [ '^upload',[ ['myUpload'] ] ] ]}}" data-ref="avatar" pageType="{{pageType}}" style="position:absolute;bottom:0;" vueId="e9d04464-4"></avatar>
</view>
